+# =====================
+# PostgreSQL: 256 MB limit (current usage: 97 MB)  → 2.6x headroom
+# Redis:      128 MB limit (current usage: 13 MB)  → 10x headroom  
+# Neo4j:      2 GB limit   (current usage: 1.47 GB) → 36% headroom
+# 
+# Total Container Memory: 2.384 GB (down from unlimited/11.67 GB per container)
+# Docker Desktop Memory:  Recommend 4 GB (down from 11.67 GB)
+# 
+# TOTAL SYSTEM SAVINGS:   ~7-8 GB of RAM freed up!
+#
+# Performance Impact:     Minimal to none - all limits well above current usage
+# Stability Impact:       Improved - prevents memory bloat and OOM scenarios
+
